<title>SPAIN: FORECAST - Telefonica Q1 net seen up 20 pct.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Telefonica Q1 net seen up 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a consensus of analyst forecasts for Telefonica 1997 first quarter results.</p>
<p>(billions of pesetas unless stated):</p>
<p>				  Q1 1997    Q1 1996    RANGE</p>
<p>    Operating income	517.46    447.70    501.00-546.90</p>
<p>    Operating margin	133.41    116.20    126.00-158.40</p>
<p>    Net attributable	 28.90     24.08     28.40-29.50</p>
<p>CONTRIBUTORS: AB Asesores, Agesban, Argentaria, BBV, Beta Capital, Ibersecurities and an analyst from a foreign bank.</p>
<p>Telefonica is due to announce Q1 results on May 12.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom, + 34 1 585-2196</p>
</text>
